### ========== 장바구니 API ==========

### 장바구니 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/carts
X-Loopers-LoginId: nahyeon
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Hx7!mK2@

### 장바구니 상품 추가
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/carts/items
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: nahyeon
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Hx7!mK2@

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

### 장바구니 수량 변경
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/carts/items/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: nahyeon
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Hx7!mK2@

{
  "quantity": 5
}

### 장바구니 상품 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/carts/items/1
X-Loopers-LoginId: nahyeon
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Hx7!mK2@
